### N5 — nit — hard-coded cache path in the readback test
`tests/test_exp06_heading.py:256`: use `sim_to_real.haa_dataset.DEFAULT_ROOT` (honours `HAA_XRIR_ROOT`) instead of the literal `/home/yixunhu/data_cache/HAA_xrir`.

